Description: Rename and process photos and videos from their EXIF metadata
 process-media is a command-line tool that scans photos and videos, reads
 their EXIF metadata to rename them after their creation date
 (YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS), then applies configurable transformations: resize,
 rotation, JPEG recompression, metadata stripping, video re-encoding and
 thumbnail generation.
 .
 Output flavours are defined in a YAML configuration file so the same source
 collection can be processed in several variants in a single run.

